  "ruleText": "Agr 1410.06 Licensing Fees for Weighmasters.\n\n(a) The fee for an initial weighmaster license shall be $96.\n\n(b) The fee for renewal of a weighmaster license shall be $96.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400) #12424, eff 12-1-17",
